SUMMARY:Passport to Dry Creek Valley
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the 35th anniversary of Passport to Dry Creek Valley\, a beloved spring wine and food weekend featuring 50+ wineries from April 24–26. This immersive experience invites guests to explore the valley while tasting award-winning wines\, enjoying thoughtfully paired local bites\, and connecting with winemakers and founders.    Live music\, exclusive perks\, and scenic vineyard settings create a lively and memorable atmosphere throughout the weekend. Guests can sip\, stroll\, and discover the unique character of Dry Creek Valley at their own pace.    More than just a ticket\, this event supports the region’s agricultural heritage\, local farmers\, grape growers\, and the community that makes it all possible.    Join fellow wine lovers for a fun-filled celebration of wine\, food\, and the spirit of Dry Creek Valley.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/passport-to-dry-creek-valley-weekend/
LOCATION:1207 Vine St, Healdsburg, CA, 95448, CA
GEO:-122.873229;38.610512
CATEGORIES:Drink,Featured Food & Wine Events,Featured Wine Events,Food,Food & Wine,Spirit,Tastings,Wine,Wine Tasting
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2023/01/22135439/Passport-Dry-Creek-Vineyards-Sonoma.jpg
END:VEVENT
